 "title": "Mike Mazzei",
 "intro": "Mike Mazzei (Republican Party) is running for election for Governor of Oklahoma. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the Republican primary runoff on August 25, 2026.\nMazzei (Republican Party) was a member of the Oklahoma State Senate, representing District 25. He assumed office in 2004. He left office in 2016.",
